{"t":"RDDT","made":"2026-11-26 02:57","name":"Reddit, Inc.","ko":"레딧","sector":"Communication Services","industry":"Internet Content & Information","employees":2555,"hq":"San Francisco, CA, United States","website":"https://redditinc.com","summary_en":"Reddit, Inc. operates a digital community in the United States and internationally. The company's platform enables user to engage in conversations, explore passions, research new hobbies, exchange goods and services, create new communities and experiences, share laughs, and find belonging. It also organizes communities based on specific interests that enable users to engage in conversations by sharing experiences, submitting links, uploading images and videos, and replying to one another. Reddit, Inc. was founded in 2005 and is headquartered in San Francisco, California.","quote_type":"EQUITY","summary_ko":"Reddit, Inc.는 미국과 국제적으로 디지털 커뮤니티를 운영하고 있습니다. 회사의 플랫폼을 통해 사용자는 대화에 참여하고, 열정을 탐구하고, 새로운 취미를 연구하고, 상품과 서비스를 교환하고, 새로운 커뮤니티와 경험을 만들고, 웃음을 공유하고, 소속감을 찾을 수 있습니다. 또한 사용자가 경험 공유, 링크 제출, 이미지 및 비디오 업로드, 서로 응답을 통해 대화에 참여할 수 있도록 특정 관심사를 기반으로 커뮤니티를 구성합니다. Reddit, Inc.는 2005년에 설립되었으며 캘리포니아주 샌프란시스코에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","val":{"price":90.14,"mcap":17405468672.0,"pe":18.395918,"fpe":9.905069,"peg":0.4161,"ps":5.63488,"pb":4.860085,"ev_ebitda":15.614,"div":0.0,"beta":2.275,"hi52":263.5,"lo52":84.595},"fin":{"rev":3088880128.0,"rev_g":0.53,"eps_g":0.749,"gross":0.91547996,"op":0.29397,"net":0.32105,"roe":0.32029998,"fcf":811615232.0,"cash":3033432064.0,"debt":31409000.0,"de":0.877,"eps":4.9,"feps":9.10039},"own":{"short":0.1475,"inst":0.97605,"insider":0.00667},"analyst":{"n":29,"mean":148.46207,"median":145.0,"high":272.0,"low":85.0,"rec":"buy","recMean":2.21875,"trend":[{"index":0,"period":"0m","strongBuy":5,"buy":11,"hold":15,"sell":1,"strongSell":0},{"index":1,"period":"-1m","strongBuy":5,"buy":13,"hold":15,"sell":1,"strongSell":0},{"index":2,"period":"-2m","strongBuy":6,"buy":16,"hold":11,"sell":1,"strongSell":0},{"index":3,"period":"